<title>SOUTH KOREA: SKorean LG Int'l '96 net rises.</title>
<headline>SKorean LG Int'l '96 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>	 (billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)			   813    vs	  641</p>
<p>    Net				   21.7   vs	  13.9</p>
<p>    Pre-tax net			 36.3   vs	  21.8</p>
<p>    Turnover			14,041.1   vs    10,447.8</p>
<p>Dividend (pct, par 5,000 won)</p>
<p>			 in cash	   3.0   vs     8.0</p>
<p>			 in stock	 10.0   vs    none</p>
<p>    Extraordinary gain		15.7   vs    20.7</p>
<p>Note - LG International Corp, the trading arm of the LG Group, said its 1996 share capital was unchanged at 26.67 million.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5644</p>
</text>
